#: ../../source/docs/common-using-a-current-sensor.rst:6
#: e3d5045a77d44a4e8103fb30a6111280
msgid "Archived Topic: Attopilot 180A Voltage and Current Sensor"
msgstr "归档主题：Attopilot 180A 电压和电流传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-using-a-current-sensor.rst:8
#: 8ac4a9e488614148b3dacb81e46b74f1
msgid ""
"In general it is best to use a power module specifically designed to work "
"with autopilots but for cases where you need to measure over the voltage "
"limit (i.e. > 18V) or current limit (i.e. > 90Amps) of the available power "
"modules you may wish to use an `AttoPilot 180A current and voltage module "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10644>`__ which can be purchased from "
"`Sparkfun <https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10644>`__."
msgstr ""
"通常最好使用专为飞控设计的电源模块，但对于需要超过可用电源模块的电压限制（即 > 18V）或电流限制（即 > 90A）的情况，可以使用 "
"`AttoPilot 180A 电流和电压模块 <https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10644>`__，可从 "
"`Sparkfun <https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10644>`__ 购买。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-using-a-current-sensor.rst:11
#: c0153fa8200f41c79ad948624a2f5da0
msgid "Connection to Pixhawk"
msgstr "连接到 Pixhawk"

#: ../../source/docs/common-using-a-current-sensor.rst:17
#: 8b420d80a56749f18cdfc90edf6a022e
msgid "Pixhawk/ to Attopilot 180A Voltage/Current Sensor Wiring Diagram"
msgstr "Pixhawk/ 到 Attopilot 180A 电压/电流传感器接线图"

#: ../../source/docs/common-using-a-current-sensor.rst:19
#: 747206e6a2be4523ac6d0a6fde0868be
msgid ""
"Connecting the autopilot sensor to the Pixhawk requires modifying a `DF13 6 "
"position cable "
"<http://store.jdrones.com/cable_df13_6pin_25cm_p/cbldf13p6c25.htm>`__ as "
"shown in the photo above including connecting:"
msgstr ""
"将飞控传感器连接到 Pixhawk 需要如上图所示修改 `DF13 6 针线缆 "
"<http://store.jdrones.com/cable_df13_6pin_25cm_p/cbldf13p6c25.htm>`__，连接方式包括："

#: ../../source/docs/common-using-a-current-sensor.rst:23
#: 2249899d9c8c45dfb38fcb0797bec63d
msgid "V pin (voltage) to the Pixhawk's 3rd pin from the left"
msgstr "V 引脚（电压）连接到 Pixhawk 从左数第 3 针"

#: ../../source/docs/common-using-a-current-sensor.rst:24
#: a861c9d6b1914be8bfa40ece8ba70205
msgid "I pin (current) to the Pixhawk's 4th pin from the left"
msgstr "I 引脚（电流）连接到 Pixhawk 从左数第 4 针"

#: ../../source/docs/common-using-a-current-sensor.rst:25
#: 72c62e545ec94ec897661497d5d36853
msgid "GND pin (ground) to the 1st pin on the left"
msgstr "GND 引脚（地）连接到左数第 1 针"

#: ../../source/docs/common-using-a-current-sensor.rst:28
#: db29843b761441229b98aa4756506364
msgid "Setup in Mission Planner"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-using-a-current-sensor.rst:30
#: 63b4c69cb2a2444a97c4d451ed6b118b
msgid ""
"To configure the sensor go to the Mission Planner's INITIAL SETUP > Optional"
" Hardware > Battery Monitor page and set the \"Monitor\", \"Sensor\" and "
"\"APM\" fields as shown in the image below.  If a battery is then connected "
"you should see the \"Battery voltage (Calced)\" field become populated with "
"the voltage of the battery."
msgstr ""
"要配置传感器，请进入 Mission Planner 的 INITIAL SETUP > Optional Hardware > Battery "
"Monitor 页面，并如下图所示设置「Monitor」、「Sensor」和「APM」字段。连接电池后，您应该会看到「Battery voltage "
"(Calced)」字段显示电池电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-using-a-current-sensor.rst:39
#: fa81b183bf1e4437a92efd6f290f5761
msgid ""
"Note: Due to the voltage scaling of the sensor to 3.3V, the maximum current "
"you can measure with the 180Amp sensor described here is actually 272Amps "
"and for the smaller `AttoPilot 90A sensor "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9028>`__ it is 136Amps."
msgstr ""
"注意：由于传感器电压缩放至 3.3V，此处描述的 180A 传感器实际可测量的最大电流为 272A，较小的 `AttoPilot 90A 传感器 "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9028>`__ 为 136A。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-using-a-current-sensor.rst:47
#: 3eb3d06d2a3c4c50b5ad534068a188cf
msgid "Calibrating the voltage sensor"
msgstr "校准电压传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-using-a-current-sensor.rst:49
#: cbb09ebf0837411084baa3da92192dac
msgid ""
"You can calibrate the voltage sensor to match the voltage from a hand-held "
"volt meter by following the instructions on the power module calibration "
"page :ref:`here <common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner>`."
msgstr ""
"您可以按照电源模块校准页面 :ref:`此处 <common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-"
"planner>` 的说明，通过手持电压表将电压传感器校准到匹配值。"
